WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.258
On the Flickr-Landscape benchmark,

00:00:02.338 --> 00:00:06.179
InfinityGAN holds a steady quality slope as output grows,

00:00:06.259 --> 00:00:09.686
while baselines drift far from realistic structure.

00:00:09.766 --> 00:00:13.813
Beyond four-times extension it beats the strongest
baseline,

00:00:13.893 --> 00:00:21.654
scoring a scale-invariant FID of sixty-one point
four at four-times versus seventy-nine point eight for StyleGAN2,

00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:25.574
and one twenty-one versus one eighty-nine at eight-times.

00:00:25.654 --> 00:00:31.007
Its memory stays constant, while StyleGAN2 runs out
of memory at sixteen-times.

00:00:31.087 --> 00:00:34.790
And over ninety percent preferred it over every method.
